    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>New package mcp-bugzilla: rename of bugzilla-mcp to match the upstream project name (github.com/openSUSE/mcp-bugzilla). Carries Provides/Obsoletes: bugzilla-mcp (and python313-bugzilla-mcp) for clean migration. A separate delete request for the old bugzilla-mcp package accompanies this.</comment>
