    <comment>Update to 0.20.0: adds get_component_defaults tool, reset_qa_contact/reset_assigned_to in update_bug_fields, and a --tool-search BM25 meta-tool mode; fastmcp floor raised to 3.4.7 (already in Factory). Local aarch64 build green, %check import test passes, rpmlint clean.</comment>
    <requestid>1371682</requestid>
